      "r": 255,
      "g": 255,
      "b": 255,
      "a": 255
    },
    "_string": "1. Players can place bets on the fruit or 77 they predict the wheel will stop on, in order to earn rewards.\n2. Players need to select the betting amount before starting the game.\n3. Players can choose either watermelon or prune on the wheel.\n4. lf the result matches the player's bet, they will receive rewards based on the odds.\n5. Different options have different odds, players can analyze the probability of options by observing the gamehistory.\n6. When lucky 77 occurs, there is a chance to hit multiple awards at the same time.",
